 "notes": "USGS OF-81-380 (Secor, 1980), first technical report on geology around Monticello Reservoir (Fairfield, Newberry and Lexington Counties): preliminary geologic maps of the Chapin, Little Mountain and part of the Jenkinsville quadrangles (plates I-III), magnetic profiles (IV-V) and joint stereonets (VI-IX). Unit symbols read from the figure 5 legend image (page 28). Plate map faces (pages 1-9, OCR) not itemized; magnetic profile values and individual joint stations not recorded. Dike-related magnetic anomalies (700-1600 gammas) noted only in text. SUBSURFACE: none.",
